And John was wearing a garment made of camel's hair, with a leather belt around his waist, and his food was locusts and wild honey.
And the people were walking from Jerusalem and all Judea and the surrounding regions of Jordan.
And they confessed their sins and their deeds in the Jordan Valley.
And when he saw many Pharisees and Sadducees coming to be baptized by him, he said to them: "You offspring of vipers! Who warned you to flee from the coming wrath of God?"
