And Jesus was walking along the shore of the Sea of Galilee, he saw two brothers, Simon, whom he called Peter, and his brother Andrew, casting a net into the lake, because they were fishermen.
And he said to them: "Follow me, and I will make you fishers of men."
And at the time, they left their window and followed him.
