And I will say to them: "I never knew you. Depart from me, you who practice evil!"» Like the two houses (Luke 6:47-49)
Whoever listens to my words and acts upon them to be like a wise man built his house on the rock.
The rain poured and the floods came, and the wind blew strongly on that house, but it did not fall, because its foundation is built on stone.
Whoever hears my words and does not act on them is like a foolish man who built his house on sand.
The rain poured, the floods came, and the wind blew on that house, and it fell, leaving nothing of it behind.»
